      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Guard Against Null `dev_handle_`, Remove C-Style `struct`, and Eliminate Unreachable Post-Loop Code:**\n\n1. **Null-handle guard:** Unlike `enable_download()`, `find_dfu_interface()` (and its caller `dfu_detach()`) does not check `if (!dev_handle_) return false;` before calling `libusb_get_device(dev_handle_)`, which dereferences `dev_handle_` unconditionally inside `libusb`.\n2. **Unnecessary `struct` keyword (line 289):** In C++, `const libusb_interface_descriptor *alt` does not need the `struct` keyword (matching `libusb_device` and `libusb_config_descriptor` on lines 273–274).\n3. **Unreachable code after the loop (lines 333–338):** Because the loop body unconditionally returns `true` at line 327 as soon as a DFU interface is found, reaching line 331 guarantees that no DFU interface was found and `dfu_interface_` is still `-1`. The `if (dfu_interface_ \u003c 0)` check is always true and `return true;` at line 338 is unreachable dead code.\n\n```cpp\nbool RtsUsbDevice::find_dfu_interface()\n{\n\tif (!dev_handle_)\n\t\treturn false;\n\n\tlibusb_device *dev \u003d libusb_get_device(dev_handle_);\n\tlibusb_config_descriptor *config \u003d nullptr;\n\n\tint ret \u003d libusb_get_active_config_descriptor(dev, \u0026config);\n\tif (ret \u003c 0) {\n\t\tfprintf(stderr, \"Error: cannot get config descriptor: %s\\n\",\n\t\t\tlibusb_error_name(ret));\n\t\treturn false;\n\t}\n\n\tdfu_interface_ \u003d -1;\n\ttransfer_size_ \u003d kDfuDefaultTransferSize;\n\n\t/* Walk all interfaces and alternate settings. */\n\tfor (uint8_t i \u003d 0; i \u003c config-\u003ebNumInterfaces; i++) {\n\t\tfor (int j \u003d 0; j \u003c config-\u003einterface[i].num_altsetting; j++) {\n\t\t\tconst libusb_interface_descriptor *alt \u003d\n\t\t\t\t\u0026config-\u003einterface[i].altsetting[j];\n\n\t\t\tif (alt-\u003ebInterfaceClass !\u003d kDfuClass ||\n\t\t\t    alt-\u003ebInterfaceSubClass !\u003d kDfuSubclass)\n\t\t\t\tcontinue;\n\n\t\t\tdfu_interface_ \u003d alt-\u003ebInterfaceNumber;\n\t\t\ttransfer_size_ \u003d parse_dfu_transfer_size(\n\t\t\t\talt-\u003eextra, alt-\u003eextra_length);\n\n\t\t\tlibusb_free_config_descriptor(config);\n\t\t\tprintf(\"DFU interface found: #%d\\n\", dfu_interface_);\n\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tlibusb_free_config_descriptor(config);\n\tfprintf(stderr, \"Error: no DFU interface found on device.\\n\");\n\treturn false;\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/46b34316-d342-48c7-a7f3-1c5d7cf82dbc)",
